  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Ukraine National Energy and Climate Plan and establishment of the Green Transition Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: Effective support provided to ensure NECP adoption
Output 2: NECP explained to audiences inside Ukraine and abroad, partners inspired to join supporting implementation
Output 3: Effective NECP monitoring system installed and functioning
Output 4: Strong cooperation with the UK Climate Change Committee and similar international bodies; analysis conducted of GHG emission reduction potential in one sector of the Ukrainian economy.
Output 5: Effective support of program for green project financing
Output 6: Development of the NECP implementation plan and coordination of its implementation
Output 7: Action plan for implementation of Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) in Ukraine
Output 8: Launching an accelerator for exporters and/or entrepreneurs in the field of green transition (in partnership with UN Global Compact)</narrative>
  </description>
